<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Indosat first half net up 15.8 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Indosat first half net up 15.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in billion rupiah except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Net profit			272.2	  vs    235.1</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)    262.9	  vs    227.1</p>
<p>    Operating revenues	    679.9	  vs    579.1</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	    355.7	  vs    299.2</p>
<p>    Total other income	     45.5	  vs     42.4</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	   1,133.2	  vs    768.6</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation, also listed in New York, is a state-controlled telecommunications firm.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
